description	"Kyle Katarn

An elite mercenary equipped for Run and Gun combat with tougher armor & fast reflexes.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Kyle's Modified Bryar Pistol (3)
-- 20% more charged FP damage
-- 20% less velocity
- E-11 Blaster Rifle (2)
-- 20% faster RoF
- 3 Heavy Thermal Grenades
-- 100% more damage
-- Pushes on det
- 3 I.M. Mines (Manual Detonation)
-- 100% more damage
- Stun Baton (2)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (1)

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Slow Faller
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (1)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]

After receiving additional intel of a spare Battalion of Dark Troopers stationed on Gall, Mon Mothma hired the services of Mercenary-For-Hire Kyle Katarn once more to assist Dash Rendar & General Calrissian's rescue mission."